Stool analysis is a critical diagnostic tool for identifying the causes of chronic diarrhea. This test can help differentiate between various underlying conditions, guiding appropriate treatment strategies. The relationship between chronic diarrhea and stool analysis underscores the importance of accurate diagnosis in managing this complex condition. [Data: Entities (12143), Relationships (15185)]

