The food industry plays a significant role in the development and application of thickeners to enhance food safety and quality. By incorporating thickeners into various food products, the industry addresses nutritional deficiencies and improves the texture and stability of foods, particularly for those with swallowing difficulties. This includes the formulation of fortified foods that cater to specific dietary needs, ensuring that individuals can consume safe and nutritious options. The relationship between the food industry and thickeners is crucial for advancing dietary solutions for dysphagia patients [Data: Entities (784); Relationships (5058, 5070)].

