The community focuses on the concept of 'calidad de vida' (quality of life) and its relationship with various health conditions and nutritional interventions. Key entities include quality of life metrics, cost-utility analyses, and specific questionnaires that assess the impact of nutrition on health outcomes, particularly in patients with chronic conditions.

