Calidad de vida is a comprehensive measure that encompasses the overall well-being and life satisfaction of individuals, particularly in the context of health conditions. It is influenced by various factors, including medical treatments and nutritional status. The importance of quality of life is underscored in healthcare, where it is often assessed through cost-utility analyses and questionnaires. This holistic view emphasizes the need for tailored interventions to improve life satisfaction and well-being, especially for patients with chronic conditions. [Data: Entities (279); Relationships (2238, 797, 2240, 2241, 2242, 2247, +more)]

