The relationship between Clinical Nutrition Units and Specialized Information Systems highlights a significant interdependence. Clinical Nutrition Units utilize these information systems to streamline their operations and improve patient care. This reliance indicates that any issues with the information systems could directly affect the quality of nutritional care provided to patients, making the integrity of these systems paramount. [Data: Relationships (20375)]

