## Link between chronic kidney disease and PEW

Chronic kidney disease is closely associated with Protein-Energy Wasting due to an imbalance between protein degradation and synthesis. This relationship underscores the importance of monitoring and managing nutritional intake in patients with chronic kidney disease to prevent the onset of PEW. Understanding this link is essential for healthcare providers to implement effective treatment strategies. [Data: Relationships (9157)]

